OL,3,GNEWSAMarine protected areas to expand
OL,4,Aby further 15%
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe area of sea around Jersey protected
OL,7,Fagainst damaging fishing practices is
OL,8,Fto be expanded by more than 15%.
OL,10,FThe government said the marine
OL,11,Fprotected area network, which is
OL,12,Fterritorial waters off limits to
OL,13,Ftrawling and dredging, would be
OL,14,Fincreasing from 6.5% to 21.7%.
OL,16,FIt said the measures, coming into force
OL,17,Fon September 1, would protect some of
OL,18,Fthe island's most important marine
OL,19,Fhabitats, including its sensitive and
OL,20,Fbiodiverse shallow reefs, and would
OL,21,Fhelp keep fish stocks sustainable for
OL,22,Fthe fishing industry.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
