OL,3,GNEWSAMarine protected areas to expand
OL,4,Aby further 15%
OL,5,
OL,6,FMinister for the Environment Mary Le
OL,7,FHegerat said Jersey's seas were "one of
OL,8,Fthe island's greatest natural assets"
OL,9,Fand needed continuous protection.
